# This repository is the PUBLIC face of RawFrame. It holds the README, the licence and
# screenshots — nothing else. The source code is private and must never be added here,
# so the entries below are a second line of defence behind that rule: even if a file is
# copied into this folder by accident, git will not offer to commit it.
#
# Once something is pushed it stays in the repository's history even after a later commit
# deletes it, so the only reliable place to stop a mistake is here.

## The published binary
# RawFrame.exe belongs on the Releases page as an attachment, not in git. It is about
# 70 MB: committed once, every clone of this repository carries it forever, and GitHub
# starts warning past 50 MB. Releases have none of those problems and a 2 GB limit.
*.exe
*.zip
*.7z
*.msi

## Source code, in case a copy is ever dropped in here
# Nothing in this repository is ever built, so none of this belongs in it.
src/
tests/
tools/
*.cs
*.csproj
*.sln
*.xaml
*.manifest
*.pubxml

## The private build notes
# docs/ itself is left available for screenshots; only the internal document is blocked.
docs/BUILD.md

## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
publish/
*.dll
*.pdb
*.cache

## Recordings and logs, which are personal
*.mp4
*.log

## Windows and editor noise
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
